{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48064","headline":"与谢翶赠荅诗 三 · 金车美人","name":"与谢翶赠荅诗 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一纸华笺洒碧云，余香犹在墨犹新。\n空添满目凄凉事，不见三山缥缈人。\n斜月照衣今夜梦，落花啼鸟去年春。\n红闺更有堪愁处，窗上虫丝几上尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"金车美人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}